---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  description="Software engineer with 14 years of experience. Currently at XTEL, previously Tasq, BriteCore, and co-founder of Chef Galaxy."
  canonicalPath="/"
>
  <section class="section-about">
    <h1 class="heading-2 heading-2--dark">About</h1>
    <p class="text">
      Waseem Jan is a software engineer currently at XTEL, working on tools that help consumer goods
      companies plan promotions and pricing. Before that he spent time at Tasq and BriteCore, and
      earlier co-founded <strong>Chef Galaxy</strong>, a marketplace for hiring chefs. It didn't last,
      but building it end to end taught him a lot.
    </p>
    <p class="text">
      Along the way he's worn DevOps and frontend hats as well as backend ones.
    </p>
    <p class="text">
      He lives in Kamra, Pakistan with his wife <b>Yusaira</b> and two sons, <b>Azlan</b> and
      <b>Zaman</b>. He's also fond of parrots and keeps an aviary of
      <a href="https://lafeber.com/pet-birds/species/cockatiel/" target="blank">cockatiels</a> and
      <a href="https://lafeber.com/pet-birds/species/budgie-parakeet/" target="blank">budgies</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="text">
      He holds a bachelor's degree in Software Engineering from the
      <a href="https://giki.edu.pk" target="blank">GIK Institute</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="text">
      Don't forget to read his <a href="/blog" class="btn-text">blog &rarr;</a> and feel free to email
      him at syedwaseemjan@gmail.com.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
